    <item>
      <title>OpenAI 低調開發「真人」社交網絡　擬用生物識別技術杜絕機械人帳號</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/02/08/openai-developing-social-platform-biometric-verification/tech-secure/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=openai-developing-social-platform-biometric-verification</link>
      <description>OpenAI 正低調籌建一款全新社交網絡產品，核心賣點為「只為真人而設」，試圖從根本解決長期困擾社交平台、特別是 X（前稱 Twitter）的機械人帳號問題。項目目前仍處於極早期開發階段，由不足 10 人小團隊推進，但 OpenAI 內部構想已逐漸聚焦在利用生物識別技術驗證用戶身份。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/02/08/openai-developing-social-platform-biometric-verification/tech-secure/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=openai-developing-social-platform-biometric-verification</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 12:00:34 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>日本推出指紋認證智能水樽　杜絕飲品被偷飲或下藥風險</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/02/08/haslux-c-mon-fingerprint-smart-water-bottle/life-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=haslux-c-mon-fingerprint-smart-water-bottle</link>
      <description>日本公司 Haslux 早前正式推出配備指紋認證鎖定功能的智能水樽 c-mon，透過生物識別技術確保只有登記用戶才能開啟瓶蓋。這款產品針對近年職場、學校及健身室頻繁出現的飲品誤飲或惡作劇事件而設計，為個人水樽安全帶來全新解決方案。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/02/08/haslux-c-mon-fingerprint-smart-water-bottle/life-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=haslux-c-mon-fingerprint-smart-water-bottle</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/7318712d94505d1217d7-694x463.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 13:14:47 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
